Quick Exam Concepts from this Exercise
Important resources:
Pod → container runtime unit
Deployment → manages pods
Project → OpenShift namespace
Service → internal networking
Route → external access
Operator → automated cluster management
Important commands:
Login:
oc login
Get console:
oc whoami --show-console
Pods:
oc get pods
Deployments:
oc get deployments
Services:
oc get services
Routes:
oc get routes

